SUMMARY:FirstWord: Consistency as a Competitive Advantage in a Changing Mar
 ket: Lessons from a Growth Brand’s Access Strategy
DESCRIPTION:As brands move beyond launch\, sustaining growth often means na
 vigating evolving utilization management requirements\, new competitive en
 trants\, and increasingly complex coverage criteria. These market dynamics
  can create new barriers to therapy adoption\, making patient access a key
  driver of long-term commercial performance.\n\nDrawing on recent insights
  from CoverMyMeds\, this webinar will examine how one growth-stage brand m
 aintained an observed average 22-point improvement*\, in claim approval ra
 tes through increasing prior authorization requirements\, indication expan
 sion\, and market disruption. CoverMyMeds thought leaders will discuss wha
 t the case study reveals about provider workflow design and why consistent
  access performance is one of the most important indicators of long-term c
 ommercial success.\nType: Sponsor Event\nSponsor: CoverMyMeds\nSpeakers: M
 egan Wetzel\, Vice President\, Access & Affordability\, CoverMyMeds\; Curt
  Wanek\, Senior Director\, Business Intelligence\, CoverMyMeds\; and Jo Sh
 orthouse\, Moderator\, FirstWord\nRegister Now: https://us02web.zoom.us/we
 binar/register/4517895889375/WN_bSkWuNi3QuG70snJSZCZlQ\nSource: https://us
 02web.zoom.us/webinar/register/4517895889375/WN_bSkWuNi3QuG70snJSZCZlQ
URL:https://us02web.zoom.us/webinar/register/4517895889375/WN_bSkWuNi3QuG70
 snJSZCZlQ
LOCATION:Online webinar
END:VEVENT
