SUMMARY:FirstWord: Unlocking Access: Navigating Pharma’s Regulatory Cross
 roads
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an exclusive discussion with leading experts as we 
 explore the most urgent regulatory and market access challenges facing the
  industry today. From the effects of global regulatory divergence between 
 the U.S.\, the EU\, the UK\, and emerging markets to the increasing pressu
 re on drug pricing and the shift toward value-based reimbursement models\,
  this discussion will highlight the latest trends and innovations transfor
 ming the pharmaceutical landscape. Our panel will also examine how AI and 
 personalized medicine\, are impacting regulatory strategies and market app
 roaches. Whether you're dealing with pricing pressures\, regulatory obstac
 les\, or entering emerging markets\, this event offers valuable insights a
 nd forward-thinking strategies to help you stay competitive in a rapidly c
 hanging market.\nType: FW Perspectives Live\nSponsor: Cencora\nSpeakers: T
 ommy Bramley\, Senior Vice President of Global Consulting Service\, Cencor
 a\; Miguel Forte\, CEO\, Kiji Therapeutics\; President and Board of Direct
 ors Chair of the International Society of Cell and Gene Therapy (ISCT)\; A
